Z||000000||fropuff||10-24-2000||08:28 PM||||Hey, there was a post before, and 1FST2M6 told me about Dri-Wash.  He said it works great, and the site testimonials say it is too.  I want to get it to get rid of buffing swirls from the paint, and to get it shined up real good.  I was wondering if anyone else uses it.  What do you think of it?  Thanks a lot.||||reg||1
Z||000001||1FST2M6||10-24-2000||10:03 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.altimas.net" TARGET=_blank>www.altimas.net</A>  look in their forum to a post by NiceDashStick (friend) i've emailed him for a before and after.. his car looked like crap on a stick then he treated it with this stuff and   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> wow what a difference...  stizick37@yahoo.com <P>------------------<BR>Shhh.. Top Secret! <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/1fstcheeto_2.jpg"> ||||reg||1
